  "fullDescription": "Back to School Goose Clipart Bundle.\nBring a smile to your classroom or school-themed projects with this adorable Back to School Goose Clipart Bundle!\nThis collection features six hand-drawn cartoon geese dressed as students, each carrying bright backpacks, holding pencils, apples, and surrounded by charming school supplies like books, rulers, crayons, and stars. Perfect for adding a playful and heartwarming touch to your teacher gifts, classroom decorations, planners, notebooks, sublimation designs, or printable stickers.\n\nEach illustration is rendered in a cute, high-quality cartoon style with clean lines and vibrant colors. The geese come with fun glasses and unique personalities, making this set ideal for children’s designs, educational resources, or whimsical back-to-school merch.\n\n✅ Included:\n26 individual goose student illustrations (transparent PNG, 300 DPI)\n\n9 Bonus school elements: books, apples, rulers, paper clips, pencils, stars\n5 – frames\n22 – goose in a frame\n\nHigh resolution, perfect for print and digital use\n\nFor personal and commercial use\n\nWhether you’re a teacher, designer, or small business owner, this kawaii school goose bundle will add a touch of joy and creativity to your projects. 🍎✏️🦢",
